title: XenServer / XCP-ng: Physical interface
agents: xenserver
catalog: app/citrix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check monitors a physical interface (PIF) or bond of a XenServer host:
 link state ({CRIT} if down), speed, bond membership, management role and
 throughput. Data comes from the special agent {agent_xenserver}.

discovery:
 One service per physical interface that has a link, is attached or is a bond member.
